  "duration_s": 91.553991,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "这藕是好藕啊，就是心眼儿太多了。领导藕虽然心眼多，但也是您的下酒菜啊。这鸭子是好鸭子，就是嘴硬，嘴硬，才守得住秘密，小李今天让你破费了。领导，您说这些您能来，就是我的荣幸，以后还有很多地方向您请教，不是你酒量挺好的呀。领导，您可抬举我了，我平时真不太能喝，这不今天和您在一起吃饭，高兴啊，这一高兴就多贪了几杯。小李，最近表现不错啊，我的这个位置马上就该你坐了，我得提前敬你一杯。听这意思，领导是要高升了呀，我得提前敬领导一杯。小李啊，我看你穿衣品味不错嘛，思想上领导的高度我望尘莫及，只能在衣品上找些自我安慰了。哎，你什么意思啊，怎么到我这儿就剩半杯了。领导美满美满，代表幸福美满，这一辈子美满就是一辈子美满啊。打这么多饭，你喂猪呢，领导，我哪儿敢啊？我还以为您的饭量和肚量是一样的呢，都说宰相肚里能撑船，更何况只是一碗饭呢，我真不怎么喜欢你，但您从来没有在工作上为难过，我领导的格局值得我们学习。哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈，关注我，每天学点高情商，说话技巧，让你的路越走越宽。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bea79c5f09be337b_s00001",
      "start_ms": 50,
      "end_ms": 1290,
      "text": "这藕是好藕啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bea79c5f09be337b_s00002",
      "start_ms": 1530,
      "end_ms": 3750,
      "text": "就是心眼儿太多了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bea79c5f09be337b_s00003",
      "start_ms": 3750,
      "end_ms": 5570,
      "text": "领导藕虽然心眼多，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bea79c5f09be337b_s00004",
      "start_ms": 5650,
      "end_ms": 6910,
      "text": "但也是您的下酒菜啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bea79c5f09be337b_s00005",
      "start_ms": 8890,
      "end_ms": 10510,
      "text": "这鸭子是好鸭子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bea79c5f09be337b_s00006",
      "start_ms": 10730,
      "end_ms": 11570,
      "text": "就是嘴硬，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bea79c5f09be337b_s00007",
      "start_ms": 11970,
      "end_ms": 12410,
      "text": "嘴硬，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bea79c5f09be337b_s00008",
      "start_ms": 12410,
      "end_ms": 13290,
      "text": "才守得住秘密，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bea79c5f09be337b_s00009",
      "start_ms": 16850,
      "end_ms": 19010,
      "text": "小李今天让你破费了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bea79c5f09be337b_s00010",
      "start_ms": 19290,
      "end_ms": 19730,
      "text": "领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bea79c5f09be337b_s00011",
      "start_ms": 19790,
      "end_ms": 21470,
      "text": "您说这些您能来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bea79c5f09be337b_s00012",
      "start_ms": 21470,
      "end_ms": 22310,
      "text": "就是我的荣幸，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bea79c5f09be337b_s00013",
      "start_ms": 22450,
      "end_ms": 24290,
      "text": "以后还有很多地方向您请教，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bea79c5f09be337b_s00014",
      "start_ms": 24290,
      "end_ms": 28230,
      "text": "不是你酒量挺好的呀。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bea79c5f09be337b_s00015",
      "start_ms": 28270,
      "end_ms": 28650,
      "text": "领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bea79c5f09be337b_s00016",
      "start_ms": 28810,
      "end_ms": 29910,
      "text": "您可抬举我了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bea79c5f09be337b_s00017",
      "start_ms": 29930,
      "end_ms": 31230,
      "text": "我平时真不太能喝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bea79c5f09be337b_s00018",
      "start_ms": 31510,
      "end_ms": 32990,
      "text": "这不今天和您在一起吃饭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bea79c5f09be337b_s00019",
      "start_ms": 32990,
      "end_ms": 33550,
      "text": "高兴啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bea79c5f09be337b_s00020",
      "start_ms": 33690,
      "end_ms": 35110,
      "text": "这一高兴就多贪了几杯。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bea79c5f09be337b_s00021",
      "start_ms": 36950,
      "end_ms": 37390,
      "text": "小李，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bea79c5f09be337b_s00022",
      "start_ms": 37410,
      "end_ms": 38590,
      "text": "最近表现不错啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bea79c5f09be337b_s00023",
      "start_ms": 38750,
      "end_ms": 40550,
      "text": "我的这个位置马上就该你坐了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bea79c5f09be337b_s00024",
      "start_ms": 40690,
      "end_ms": 41910,
      "text": "我得提前敬你一杯。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bea79c5f09be337b_s00025",
      "start_ms": 42190,
      "end_ms": 42890,
      "text": "听这意思，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bea79c5f09be337b_s00026",
      "start_ms": 42990,
      "end_ms": 44150,
      "text": "领导是要高升了呀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bea79c5f09be337b_s00027",
      "start_ms": 44230,
      "end_ms": 46005,
      "text": "我得提前敬领导一杯。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bea79c5f09be337b_s00028",
      "start_ms": 47040,
      "end_ms": 47660,
      "text": "小李啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bea79c5f09be337b_s00029",
      "start_ms": 48120,
      "end_ms": 49980,
      "text": "我看你穿衣品味不错嘛，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bea79c5f09be337b_s00030",
      "start_ms": 50580,
      "end_ms": 53080,
      "text": "思想上领导的高度我望尘莫及，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bea79c5f09be337b_s00031",
      "start_ms": 53360,
      "end_ms": 55400,
      "text": "只能在衣品上找些自我安慰了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bea79c5f09be337b_s00032",
      "start_ms": 57020,
      "end_ms": 57260,
      "text": "哎，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bea79c5f09be337b_s00033",
      "start_ms": 57500,
      "end_ms": 58460,
      "text": "你什么意思啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bea79c5f09be337b_s00034",
      "start_ms": 58580,
      "end_ms": 60140,
      "text": "怎么到我这儿就剩半杯了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bea79c5f09be337b_s00035",
      "start_ms": 60300,
      "end_ms": 61340,
      "text": "领导美满美满，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bea79c5f09be337b_s00036",
      "start_ms": 61540,
      "end_ms": 62580,
      "text": "代表幸福美满，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bea79c5f09be337b_s00037",
      "start_ms": 62820,
      "end_ms": 65545,
      "text": "这一辈子美满就是一辈子美满啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bea79c5f09be337b_s00038",
      "start_ms": 67210,
      "end_ms": 68030,
      "text": "打这么多饭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bea79c5f09be337b_s00039",
      "start_ms": 68090,
      "end_ms": 68790,
      "text": "你喂猪呢，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bea79c5f09be337b_s00040",
      "start_ms": 68890,
      "end_ms": 69270,
      "text": "领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bea79c5f09be337b_s00041",
      "start_ms": 69390,
      "end_ms": 70145,
      "text": "我哪儿敢啊？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bea79c5f09be337b_s00042",
      "start_ms": 70530,
      "end_ms": 72425,
      "text": "我还以为您的饭量和肚量是一样的呢，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bea79c5f09be337b_s00043",
      "start_ms": 72720,
      "end_ms": 74120,
      "text": "都说宰相肚里能撑船，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bea79c5f09be337b_s00044",
      "start_ms": 74240,
      "end_ms": 76025,
      "text": "更何况只是一碗饭呢，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bea79c5f09be337b_s00045",
      "start_ms": 77220,
      "end_ms": 78555,
      "text": "我真不怎么喜欢你，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bea79c5f09be337b_s00046",
      "start_ms": 79070,
      "end_ms": 80830,
      "text": "但您从来没有在工作上为难过，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bea79c5f09be337b_s00047",
      "start_ms": 80830,
      "end_ms": 83295,
      "text": "我领导的格局值得我们学习。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bea79c5f09be337b_s00048",
      "start_ms": 84440,
      "end_ms": 85955,
      "text": "哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bea79c5f09be337b_s00049",
      "start_ms": 86190,
      "end_ms": 86745,
      "text": "关注我，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bea79c5f09be337b_s00050",
      "start_ms": 87070,
      "end_ms": 88390,
      "text": "每天学点高情商，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bea79c5f09be337b_s00051",
      "start_ms": 88390,
      "end_ms": 89255,
      "text": "说话技巧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bea79c5f09be337b_s00052",
      "start_ms": 89590,
      "end_ms": 91365,
      "text": "让你的路越走越宽。"
    }
  ],
